{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463490/extras/2cf2593cc097eea27d405ff4872aab17.avif?t=1758109386\" width=600 height=75 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frosty Enterprise: Prologue is the prologue version of Frosty Enterprise</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frosty Enterprise is a game in which you can start your ice cream business. You start your journey in a floating town. Your objective is to make ice creams, milkshakes, sundaes and floats for the town's residents and to grow your business!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463490/extras/b516606fdb0a4dffb5fc81b834bdb793.avif?t=1758109386\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Frosty Enterprise Prologue! This is a small part of the game that awaits you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This prologue includes all the parts of the game to show players what they can expect more about the full game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting their business journey in their ice cream truck, players will have all access to the stores that will improve their cute ice cream business.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited number of flavors are waiting for players to explore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stores are offering small portion of their inventory for players to have and improve their business. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_p